  "description": "Image processing middleware for Vali-Blob using SixLabors.ImageSharp.\n        Provides an upload pipeline that automatically resizes, converts, and optimizes images\n        before storing them via any Vali-Blob provider (AWS S3, Azure Blob, GCP, OCI, Supabase, Local).\n        Supports thumbnail generation, format conversion (JPEG, PNG, WebP), quality control,\n        and maximum dimension constraints — all configurable via DI options.\n        Targets net6.0, net7.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
